# The OAuth config you download from the Google Cloud Console. It is fetched by
# the browser at startup for its client_id, and it also contains a client_secret
# that nothing here uses — see SECRETS-TODO.md. Copy client_config.example.json
# to client_config.json and fill in your own client_id.
client_config.json

# Anything else that looks like a secret. Git on Windows matches these without
# regard to case, so the notes file has to be excepted explicitly.
*secret*
